# Response headers for Cloudflare Pages. Pages reads this file from the root of the output
# directory and applies each block to the paths that match its first line. It is not served
# as a page itself. Syntax: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Comments stay on their own unindented lines; an indented line inside a block is a header.
#
# What the block for every path (/*) sets, line by line:
#
# Content-Security-Policy: only the site's own images and stylesheets. No scripts, fonts,
#   frames, forms or connections. The site has none, so anything else is a mistake or an
#   injection. If Cloudflare ever injects a script on the zone (Email Address Obfuscation,
#   Rocket Loader, Web Analytics, Bot Fight Mode), the browser blocks it; docs/hosting.md
#   lists the zone settings to keep off for that reason.
# Strict-Transport-Security: HTTPS only, for a year, on deskbar.app and every subdomain.
#   Deliberately without "preload": leaving the browsers' preload list takes months, so
#   opt in later, on purpose, if wanted.
# X-Content-Type-Options: the browser must not guess content types.
# X-Frame-Options: never framed. frame-ancestors in the CSP says the same for new browsers.
# Referrer-Policy: send only the origin when a visitor follows a link elsewhere.
# Permissions-Policy: the site uses none of these browser features, so all are off.
# Cross-Origin-*-Policy: keep this page's context and resources to itself.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; img-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

# Images change rarely and are small, so browsers and the edge may keep them for a day.
/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
